{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Man &amp; Dog is a hunting simulation game situated in Finland.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together with your companion dog, use real Nordic hunting methods to seek grouse birds hiding in the trees, or get into a thrilling chase with a fox or rabbit. Immerse yourself in authentic Finnish wilderness in autumn or winter.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tree-top bird hunting in winter or autumn </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/9a0e62b95eab8aa3c2669c83db989372.poster.avif?t=1772918837\" width=340 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/9a0e62b95eab8aa3c2669c83db989372.webm?t=1772918837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/9a0e62b95eab8aa3c2669c83db989372.mp4?t=1772918837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dog will try to point to the correct tree where a bird is </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/97ce81f669f502d3b4024b85589a14df.poster.avif?t=1772918837\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/97ce81f669f502d3b4024b85589a14df.webm?t=1772918837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/97ce81f669f502d3b4024b85589a14df.mp4?t=1772918837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye on the dog's path, and listen for barking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dont get too excited, it could just be barking at a squirrell!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/57ef1f8b5a548e9be1f32207af7400cc.poster.avif?t=1772918837\" width=340 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/57ef1f8b5a548e9be1f32207af7400cc.webm?t=1772918837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/57ef1f8b5a548e9be1f32207af7400cc.mp4?t=1772918837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use foliage as cover and move carefully,  prey are elusive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/319999b88a276287571b328d4b915db5.poster.avif?t=1772918837\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/319999b88a276287571b328d4b915db5.webm?t=1772918837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/319999b88a276287571b328d4b915db5.mp4?t=1772918837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Get a clear shot, branches might deflect bullets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/63830487d5cbd1f2b1ee1ddabb69cbc2.poster.avif?t=1772918837\" width=340 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/63830487d5cbd1f2b1ee1ddabb69cbc2.webm?t=1772918837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/63830487d5cbd1f2b1ee1ddabb69cbc2.mp4?t=1772918837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience atmospheric black grouse swamp hunting </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/585469ef586b5d415f2f9a496515e1d3.poster.avif?t=1772918837\" width=340 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/585469ef586b5d415f2f9a496515e1d3.webm?t=1772918837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/585469ef586b5d415f2f9a496515e1d3.mp4?t=1772918837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2794480?t=1772918837","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772918837","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772918837","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772918837","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Feature List</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Campaign and free play </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use of proper hunting tactics is required to succeed </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Companion dog: works with the player, tries to find game from the ground or trees </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic ballistics and bullet physics simulation </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic Finnish terrain: spruce forests, swamps, pine forests, and mixed forests </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather and time of day </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animal species: capercaillie, black Grouse, hazel Grouse, fox, rabbit </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Birds will perch in trees </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >seasons: autumn, winter</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Man &amp; Dog is a hunting simulation game situated in Finland.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together with your companion dog, use real Nordic hunting methods to seek grouse birds hiding in the trees, or get into a thrilling chase with a fox or rabbit. Immerse yourself in authentic Finnish wilderness in autumn or winter.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tree-top bird hunting in winter or autumn </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/9a0e62b95eab8aa3c2669c83db989372.poster.avif?t=1772918837\" width=340 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/9a0e62b95eab8aa3c2669c83db989372.webm?t=1772918837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/9a0e62b95eab8aa3c2669c83db989372.mp4?t=1772918837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dog will try to point to the correct tree where a bird is </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/97ce81f669f502d3b4024b85589a14df.poster.avif?t=1772918837\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/97ce81f669f502d3b4024b85589a14df.webm?t=1772918837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/97ce81f669f502d3b4024b85589a14df.mp4?t=1772918837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye on the dog's path, and listen for barking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dont get too excited, it could just be barking at a squirrell!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/57ef1f8b5a548e9be1f32207af7400cc.poster.avif?t=1772918837\" width=340 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/57ef1f8b5a548e9be1f32207af7400cc.webm?t=1772918837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/57ef1f8b5a548e9be1f32207af7400cc.mp4?t=1772918837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use foliage as cover and move carefully,  prey are elusive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/319999b88a276287571b328d4b915db5.post